<title>FINLAND: AKTIA TO LAUNCH FIM 40 MLN FIVE-YEAR DEBENTURE.</title>
<headline>AKTIA TO LAUNCH FIM 40 MLN FIVE-YEAR DEBENTURE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Aktia Bank said in a statement on Monday it will issue a 40 million markka five-year debenture.</p>
<p>The debenture has a variable issue price and a 5.50 percent coupon, it said.</p>
<p>The subscription period runs from December 12 to January 31, and the bond will be fully repaid on December 12, 2001.</p>
<p>A bourse listing will be sought for the bond, Aktia said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +348 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
